---
title: "Text Cell Editor"
---

Simple text editor using the standard HTML `input`, used by default when no other editor is specified.

## Enabling Text Cell Editor

Edit any cell in the grid below to see the Text Cell Editor:

{% gridExampleRunner title="Text Editor" name="text-editor" /%}

Enabled with `agTextCellEditor` and configured with `ITextCellEditorParams`.

```
columnDefs: [
    {
        cellEditor: 'agTextCellEditor',
        cellEditorParams: {
            maxLength: 20
        },
    },
]
```

## API Reference

{% interfaceDocumentation interfaceName="ITextCellEditorParams" names=["useFormatter","maxLength"] /%}
